WEBVTT

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:04.410
We can definitely do it

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:10.660
Pague...

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:21.050
So you've finally shown your face!

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:25.250
If you think you can kill us with that,
you've got another thing coming!

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:27.010
Kaoru's been spotted!

00:02:27.430 --> 00:02:30.800
He's decoying them to save us.

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:33.430
Let's run while we have the chance.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:35.750
We won't let you escape!

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:40.060
Why did he reveal himself?

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:45.580
The brats disappeared past here?

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:47.380
What do you mean?

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:52.360
This cliff is an illusion -- a facade to stop us from passing.

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:53.860
Facade?

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:56.230
Do you think we're idiots?

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:57.430
Just watch.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:00.690
Brindo!

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:05.640
He disappeared!

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:08.600
I see, that's how it was.

00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:10.360
Let's go too!

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:18.130
Damn it! Wait for me!

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:53.040
Damn it!

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:57.280
What's the deal with this island?

00:03:57.990 --> 00:04:00.540
The brats sure had their way with us, didn't they Brindo?

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:07.100
We'll pay them back for it several times over.

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:41.710
Kaoru!

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:46.590
The forest of illusion was overcome?

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:50.300
They passed the cliff and are headed this way.

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.140
It's my fault.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:55.850
Because I went out selfishly.

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:57.910
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:02.490
It's not your fault, Adam.

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:03.730
But...

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:07.780
We're friends, right Adam? Right?

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:09.910
Luna...

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.540
That's right, Adam.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:16.250
We're out of time.

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:19.210
Just like we planned.

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:20.380
Agreed.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:23.000
Sharla, take care of Adam.

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:24.650
Leave it to me.

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:25.700
Let's go.

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:40.480
Are they here?

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:45.500
It's okay. We can definitely do it!

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:49.630
We'll all escape here together. Definitely!

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:55.480
Don't let your guard down.

00:05:55.510 --> 00:05:56.790
They're definitely nearby.

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:59.830
Time to rid ourselves of this burden.

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:03.090
Don't touch me!

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:04.360
What did you say?

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:05.190
Hey!

00:06:07.890 --> 00:06:08.860
There they are!

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:16.440
Wait, she might be a decoy.

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:17.830
What?

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:20.190
Then what do we do?

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.300
Fine, go.

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:31.250
You won't get away!

00:06:51.650 --> 00:06:54.010
They really think they stand a chance against us.

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:57.760
If they were going to show off, now would be their chance.

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:00.690
I'll go this way.

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:02.450
Right. Don't get careless.

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:05.040
Who do you think you're saying that to?

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:25.360
Let's go.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.410
They're finally here.

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:34.630
We won't make it in time.

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:39.690
Mechanics have to be calm no matter the situation.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:42.460
Impatience invites mistakes.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:44.110
Right!

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:46.400
That's right... we're on the home stretch.

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:51.580
Okay, let's get to it!

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:52.930
And quickly!

00:07:58.360 --> 00:08:01.100
I'll show them I can protect this place!

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:07.060
Sharla! And Adam too, what are you doing?

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:09.090
I'm going to protect this place too!

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:10.250
Me too.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.690
It's dangerous, so get inside!

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:15.050
We can't just sit still!

00:08:16.590 --> 00:08:17.380
Sharla...

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:22.250
We're all going to escape together,
so I'll protect this place too.

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:24.240
Me too.

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:27.610
I guess so.

00:08:27.990 --> 00:08:29.640
Then let's defend together, Sharla.

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:30.910
And Adam.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:52.140
I don't have all day to chase after you like this.

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:22.100
What's wrong?

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:23.830
Finished already?

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:37.440
What's up with this?

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.560
--Menori!
--Are you okay?

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:43.810
Yes, I'm fine.

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:48.390
Damn you! Damn you all!

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:50.490
I guess phase one was successful.

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:52.290
That's a relief.

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:54.160
Let's go to the next one.

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:55.030
Yeah!

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:58.210
Let me out! Hey!

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:09.050
Do you think you can win against me?

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:13.440
Damn it, don't mock me!

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:27.610
I guess you do have a little backbone.

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:33.010
This is fun.

00:10:56.560 --> 00:10:57.610
We did it!

00:10:57.760 --> 00:10:58.550
Really?

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:03.160
Let's hurry to the next one.

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:08.000
Kids play games, after all.

00:11:18.050 --> 00:11:20.980
Well, your mischief ends now!

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:30.050
Crap!

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:34.480
Wait!

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:35.380
Damn it!

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:41.450
I'll remember this!

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:49.510
What now, children?

00:11:56.680 --> 00:11:57.460
Luna!

00:11:57.690 --> 00:11:58.630
Luna...

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:04.210
An admirable gesture.

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:08.940
As punishment for your courage...

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:11.150
...you'll be the first...

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:13.850
...to be killed.

00:12:40.740 --> 00:12:41.980
Everyone...

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:49.630
Luna!

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:55.480
What?

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:05.450
Kaoru!

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:10.930
Damn it.

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:21.800
Now's our chance. Quickly!

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:26.560
Damn them!

00:13:32.190 --> 00:13:32.940
Is your wound okay?

00:13:32.940 --> 00:13:33.690
It's fine.

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:34.890
Somehow.

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.010
We'll be killed at this rate.

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:01.330
What do we do?

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:04.100
Go on ahead. I'll stall them.

00:14:04.550 --> 00:14:07.140
A little more... if we can get a little more distance...

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:09.010
It'd be impossible against all three of them.

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:10.330
Do we have any other option?

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:23.530
An earthquake?

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:25.290
Don't panic!

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:27.280
What's that?

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:57.500
Pague!

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:01.810
This is...

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:02.710
Huge!

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.250
What are these?

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:12.610
Do you think they came to our rescue?

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:15.130
They did! I'm sure they did!

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:18.050
Maybe Adam let them know.

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:24.910
Pague!

00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:31.210
"Go!"? I know.

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:33.690
Thank you, Pague.

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:08.680
For crying out loud! They got away!

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:11.260
Those brats...

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:13.480
I'll get back at them.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:18.280
We won't let the brats have their way any more.

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:25.850
What are you doing?

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:46.030
They're here.

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:52.890
So they're here?

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:58.660
I wonder if Luna and everyone are alright.

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:01.700
In any event, there's nothing
we can do but defend this place.

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.650
If you're coming then come on!

00:17:19.210 --> 00:17:20.150
Wait!

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:23.340
It's not them, it's Luna!

00:17:23.530 --> 00:17:24.690
They're back!

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:27.390
Luna!

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:32.600
You were okay!

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:33.500
Yeah.

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:37.250
Menori, there!

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:38.410
You're hurt!

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:42.540
It only went through the clothes. I'm fine.

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:46.780
We don't have time to dawdle around here.

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:49.030
Those three will be here soon!

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:50.450
Are the repairs finished?

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:52.060
No, not yet.

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:53.000
I see...

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:55.550
But definitely soon.

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:57.130
We're out of time.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:00.310
What is this pit?

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:03.090
Hurry up and lift me out!

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:06.200
You're heavy! Hurry out of there!

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:09.990
Shut up! Hang on tight!

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:12.650
--I'm doing it, aren't I? Stop complaining!
--Straight ahead from here, huh?

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:16.250
--And they wouldn't be lost...
--And pull properly!
--What did you say?

00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:18.430
If you're going to say that, I won't help you.

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:22.250
Stop! Anything but that! I'm so close! Keep going!

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:25.960
Damn it!

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:29.680
And what's he doing?

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:35.600
What are you doing, not helping me?

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:38.410
That's right, it's unfair, Brindo.

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:50.080
What's that?

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:55.290
Do this here...

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:56.830
Are you okay, Shingo?

00:18:58.290 --> 00:18:59.150
Calm down!

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:02.110
But they'll be here soon!

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:03.950
Don't think about anything unnecessary.

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:06.580
Focus on what's in front of you.

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:10.630
That's right. We're the only ones who can fix it.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.590
We have to put all our energy into it until the end.

00:19:13.810 --> 00:19:14.750
Okay?

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:16.030
That's right.

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:18.460
You bet!

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:19.590
Here we go!

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:23.830
I won't let them do as they like!

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:31.850
Anyways, we have to buy more time.

00:19:32.490 --> 00:19:35.300
But they should be here any moment.

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:38.000
They're not opponents we
can defeat in a face-to-face fight.

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:40.780
It's true. They still have weapons.

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:43.440
Th-- then what do we do?

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:47.790
But since they don't have the laser gun anymore, they won't be able to lay hands on us so easily.

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:48.760
So?

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:54.310
I see... we barracade ourselves in here?

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:56.190
Exactly.

00:19:58.930 --> 00:20:01.060
That certainly seems to be our best tactic.

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:03.050
Okay, then let's go.

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:04.810
Adam, please.

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:26.750
That's an amazing whatever it is.

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:28.630
This is...

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:49.210
The brats are in here, right?

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:51.240
Yeah, no doubt.

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:53.150
Then let's bust in there!

00:20:53.490 --> 00:20:54.280
Hold on.

00:20:55.030 --> 00:20:57.160
This time we have to do it for certain.

00:20:57.650 --> 00:21:01.210
They're a bunch of brats! I'll crush the lot of them!

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:04.960
You should talk. They've had their way with you so far.

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:06.050
What?

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:07.850
The same goes for you!

00:21:07.850 --> 00:21:10.140
Shut up. I don't want to hear that from you.

00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:11.150
Shut it!

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:13.510
This is no time for disorder in the ranks.

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:17.640
Bob, call them out.

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:22.330
Hey! You!

00:21:23.230 --> 00:21:24.160
You hear me?

00:21:24.350 --> 00:21:25.780
Say something!

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:27.690
Can't you hear me?

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:30.050
Their plan is to barracade themselves in.

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:32.260
That's a pain.

00:21:33.010 --> 00:21:35.000
Hey! Answer me!

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:37.180
We know you're in there!

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:40.810
We can use that guy.

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:50.790
Hey! Can you hear me?

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:52.930
Say something!

00:21:53.110 --> 00:21:54.430
Come out of there now!

00:21:54.730 --> 00:21:57.010
If you don't come out, I'll come in after you.

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:02.230
What happened?

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:04.100
It's weird...

00:22:21.130 --> 00:22:22.100
Pague!

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:23.750
What's going on?

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:24.910
Shingo...

00:22:30.430 --> 00:22:33.650
We've taken your precious friend.

00:22:37.780 --> 00:22:39.240
Get out here now!

00:22:39.730 --> 00:22:41.410
Or don't you care if he dies?

00:22:43.510 --> 00:22:44.980
What a thing to happen!

00:22:48.240 --> 00:22:49.630
Damn it!

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:52.100
That's dirty!

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:08.000
We can't sacrifice Pague's life
in exchange for this space ship!

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:11.560
But what should we do?
We'll have the ship fixed soon.

00:23:11.560 --> 00:23:16.890
I have a thought.
There's new possibility we can gamble on.

00:23:16.890 --> 00:23:18.730
I get it! <i>That</i>, right?

00:23:19.030 --> 00:23:20.560
Of course!

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:24.910
What? What, what? What's <i>that</i>?
Somebody tell me!

00:23:25.780 --> 00:23:27.610
Next time: Hurry!!
